'''''The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim: Prima Official Game Guide''''' (rebranded as '''''The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim Atlas''''' in the latest edition) is the official strategy guide for [[Skyrim:Skyrim|''TES V: Skyrim'']], written by David Hodgson and published by [[wikipedia:Prima Games|Prima Games]] on November 11, 2011. There are five editions of the book: the First Edition, the Revised & Expanded Edition, the Legendary Edition, the Special Edition, and the Atlas Edition. Four of these came in a standard paperback edition and a hardcover Collector's Edition.

